---
const repository = 'https://github.com/BurakKurt06/LanghireV2';
---
<section id="download" class="py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">Get LangHireV2</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-6">This fork has no published installer linked here yet. Build from this repository to use its current fixes.</p>
    <a href={repository + '#building-from-source'} class="btn-primary">Source and build instructions</a>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-6">The current packaged validation is for Windows x64. Installers from the upstream LangHire project do not contain this fork's security changes.</p>
  </div>
</section>
